<description>&lt;p&gt;Deputy Special Envoy Claudio Cordone briefed the Security Council on Syria, warning that recovery risks becoming a missed opportunity while urging respect for the 1974 Disengagement Agreement after Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative near the Lebanon border. Turkish forces condemned Israeli incursions into southern Syria and Israeli artillery hit positions in Al-Quneitra countryside, while Turkish, Israeli and Kurdish actors continued competing over Syria's new order. Kurdish leaders Mazloum Abdi and Masrour Barzani met to discuss developments and Kurdish rights, and SDF forces remain outside the Syrian military structure. Four Syrian security personnel were killed in attacks on patrols in Hama province. 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNT291Y1V5blpNRHJ4WGpHOG14M21WUnIxcWhzM1BJZGlSYUFaUUpqMFJucU5PM0lrcTRiRHhGcDBxSU82U2M0N2JVdTdBbEt6a0Jzam9CX0hsUThLZWJxXzFhXzVhTkVtalAtWEtxOU4xUml6WWd1ZTBGQ3JxenJkVzREUkdZM2ZWWlJmSUlRUUJkcTQydm1IbHhUUjZDYk90Q056MWtxblJjLS1vczBRbE9CN250dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNWHo1ZGNhQ1BEM3hqemhpQzhFLW5qVXRjMmk2ZjZPSEZKVDZKQUNmTGZSMF9zV0ZOd3JZSlp4QUYtX2kwZjlycVIzRjNiS3JwM3VGclRWMExZUUNoQ1Q3SXdHcGNQdlNVWTVLMWJINS1WSk1yUW4wZURuR1FJSWNHYzROdVZDQ0hicUNWcHljRVkxVXNkMUVlYURCQTNKVlkyMUc4TWVmT19oTFVnVVJF?oc=5&quot;&gt;کردپرس&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNazFfT1pndUxrdE9QX19IaDBrVlo1bE9NR1dmQnZsU2ZLS3NtdDd3dHB2SVZWYTlkakd2MEFFSjVDeVpOd3JpbEVlcmtES285OG5jNG5EajZ0VGhzMnJEZEFmTm1wRnVFRGtpd1JuMXNmUVFvT0dzYURFeWZNZENJTWlsMllXZGFiRDVDV1cyeHE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab Center Washington DC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https